        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Cell-Cell Lab</i> is a grid-based puzzle game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The protagonist Fangfang needs to combine with surrounding cells to navigate freely in the petri dish.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/b4790ae3b8a1ba0441ade0594969d3bb.poster.avif?t=1780117339\" width=1170 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/b4790ae3b8a1ba0441ade0594969d3bb.webm?t=1780117339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/b4790ae3b8a1ba0441ade0594969d3bb.mp4?t=1780117339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But many obstacles stand in the way of Fangfang reaching the goal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/b291715638f9b8d97530a9582c267f2d.poster.avif?t=1780117339\" width=1170 height=716 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/b291715638f9b8d97530a9582c267f2d.webm?t=1780117339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/b291715638f9b8d97530a9582c267f2d.mp4?t=1780117339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perhaps combining with other cells or interacting with pressure plates can help you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/962175bee0bfc85e380ec2a0ac7f8203.poster.avif?t=1780117339\" width=1170 height=712 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/962175bee0bfc85e380ec2a0ac7f8203.webm?t=1780117339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/962175bee0bfc85e380ec2a0ac7f8203.mp4?t=1780117339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the same time, properly use the combine/separate ability to adjust your state and pass through narrow paths.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/76f6fa377845a1a819bc8874301ce639.poster.avif?t=1780117339\" width=1156 height=832 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/76f6fa377845a1a819bc8874301ce639.webm?t=1780117339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/76f6fa377845a1a819bc8874301ce639.mp4?t=1780117339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More mechanisms can be experienced in the game! The game also features rich level content.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/74c72b68fcfd9456ac1694e7b47459ef.avif?t=1780117339\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist can combine/separate cells (&quot;Rules&quot;) at any time to complete objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize 8 rule slots that can be acquired or canceled freely, paired with core gameplay to deliver a fresh puzzle experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skillfully use the combine and separate abilities to adjust your form when facing obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and cute art style offers a comfortable puzzle-solving experience, yet it’s by no means lacking in challenge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 3 early levels from the demo version</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concise story text depicting Fangfang’s situation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More language support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller and Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fangfang’s story may not end here? We look forward to your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Cell-Cell Lab</i> is a grid-based puzzle game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The protagonist Fangfang needs to combine with surrounding cells to navigate freely in the petri dish.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/b4790ae3b8a1ba0441ade0594969d3bb.poster.avif?t=1780117339\" width=1170 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/b4790ae3b8a1ba0441ade0594969d3bb.webm?t=1780117339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/b4790ae3b8a1ba0441ade0594969d3bb.mp4?t=1780117339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But many obstacles stand in the way of Fangfang reaching the goal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/b291715638f9b8d97530a9582c267f2d.poster.avif?t=1780117339\" width=1170 height=716 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/b291715638f9b8d97530a9582c267f2d.webm?t=1780117339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016600/extras/b291715638f9b8d97530a9582c267f2d.mp4?t=1780117339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perhaps combining with other cells or interacting with pressure plates can help you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a